title: A Housing Fund With a Coalition Price
subtitle: Delivery, a pilot, or another promise.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: poland_government_card
view-if: left_in_government = 1 and government_has_confidence = 1 and caretaker_government = 0 and housing_minister_party = "Lewica" and month_actions < max_month_actions and poland_housing_fund_timer <= 0 and household_security < 85
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; poland_housing_fund_timer = 5
card-image: img/poland/cards/housing-fund.webp

= Housing

The ministry has land, a draft and a coalition ceiling. [? if
government_party = "pis": PiS wants the cranes in its advertisements and private developers in
the financing. Our draft gives municipalities the land and the homes.?]

[? if left_is_junior_partner = 1: **[+ coalition_senior_partner +] holds the
premiership**, and the development industry has its own channel into it.
Objection risk on a contested measure: **[+ coalition_objection_risk +]%**.?]

- @programme
- @rent_regulation
- @pilot
- @guarantee

@programme
title: Launch the public housing programme
subtitle: Cost: 3 budget capacity. Municipal construction at scale — the measure the coalition is most likely to cut.
choose-if: budget >= 3 and housing_minister_party = "Lewica"
unavailable-subtitle: Requires the Housing Ministry and three budget points.
on-arrival: {!
Q.budget -= 3;
const objectionRoll = this.random.uint32() / 4294967296;
const objected =
    Q.left_is_junior_partner &&
    objectionRoll * 100 < Number(Q.coalition_objection_risk) * 1.1;
Q.last_card_objection = objected ? 1 : 0;
Q.last_card_objector = Q.coalition_senior_partner;
if (objected) {
    Q.household_security += 3;
    Q.government_delivery += 2;
    Q.left_coalition_dissent += 7;
    Q.coalition_blur += 3;
    Q.government_coalition_dissent += 4;
    Q.household_policy_pressure += 4;
    Q.progressives_dissent += 3;
    Q.ministry_overruled_count += 1;
    Q.ministry_overruled_last = "Public housing programme";
    Q.government_goal_housing = 1;
    Q.news_headline =
        Q.coalition_senior_partner +
        " turns the public housing programme into a developer subsidy";
} else {
    Q.household_security += 8;
    Q.government_delivery += 7;
    Q.labor_credibility += 3;
    Q.young_support += 3;
    Q.urban_progressive_support += 2;
    Q.anti_establishment_youth_left_affinity += 3;
    Q.metropolitan_liberals_left_affinity += 2;
    Q.household_policy_pressure =
        Math.max(0, Q.household_policy_pressure - 12);
    Q.government_goal_housing = 2;
    if (Q.government_party == "pis") {
        Q.government_coalition_dissent += 6;
        Q.pis_relation -= 3;
    } else {
        Q.ko_coalition_dissent += 6;
    }
    Q.news_headline = "The cabinet launches a public housing programme";
}
!}


[? if last_card_objection = 1: The programme survives in name. The financing
instrument is rewritten so that municipalities co-finance private developments
instead of building, the land bank becomes "available for competitive
disposal", and the completion target moves beyond the parliamentary term.?][? if
last_card_objection = 0: Municipal land, public financing and public ownership at
the end of it. The first tranche is small enough to be honest about and large
enough to be visible in four cities.?]

[? if last_card_objection = 1: Somebody in the Chancellery briefed the
development industry before they briefed us.?]

- #poland_card_finish


@rent_regulation
title: Regulate indexation and licence the rental market
subtitle: Cost: 1 budget capacity. Cheap, immediate and aimed at the landlord vote nobody else will touch.
choose-if: budget >= 1 and housing_minister_party = "Lewica"
unavailable-subtitle: Requires the Housing Ministry and one budget point.
on-arrival: {!
Q.budget -= 1;
const objectionRoll = this.random.uint32() / 4294967296;
const objected =
    Q.left_is_junior_partner &&
    objectionRoll * 100 < Number(Q.coalition_objection_risk) * 0.95;
Q.last_card_objection = objected ? 1 : 0;
Q.last_card_objector = Q.coalition_senior_partner;
if (objected) {
    Q.household_security += 1;
    Q.left_coalition_dissent += 5;
    Q.coalition_blur += 2;
    Q.household_policy_pressure += 3;
    Q.ministry_overruled_count += 1;
    Q.ministry_overruled_last = "Rental indexation cap";
    Q.government_goal_housing = Math.max(
        1,
        Number(Q.government_goal_housing) || 0
    );
    Q.news_headline =
        Q.coalition_senior_partner +
        " blocks the indexation cap as an interference with contracts";
} else {
    Q.household_security += 5;
    Q.young_support += 4;
    Q.urban_progressive_support += 3;
    Q.anti_establishment_youth_left_affinity += 4;
    Q.metropolitan_liberals_left_affinity += 3;
    Q.government_delivery += 3;
    Q.razem_cooperation += 3;
    Q.household_policy_pressure =
        Math.max(0, Q.household_policy_pressure - 9);
    Q.ko_poll_momentum -= 0.2;
    Q.economic_issue_salience += 2;
    Q.government_goal_housing = Math.max(
        1,
        Number(Q.government_goal_housing) || 0
    );
    if (Q.government_party == "pis") {
        Q.government_coalition_dissent += 3;
    } else {
        Q.ko_coalition_dissent += 5;
        Q.p2050_coalition_dissent += 3;
    }
    Q.news_headline =
        "Rent indexation is capped and the rental market gets a public register";
}
!}


[? if last_card_objection = 0: Indexation is tied to wage growth, deposits are
held in escrow, and every tenancy enters a register that makes the market
visible for the first time. It costs almost nothing and reaches every renter in
the country this quarter rather than in four years.?][? if last_card_objection =
1: The cap is withdrawn before first reading with an argument about the sanctity
of contracts, offered by people whose own tenancy agreements are not indexed to
anything.?]

[? if last_card_objection = 0: The people it costs are organised, articulate and
mostly vote for our coalition partners.?]

- #poland_card_finish


@pilot
title: Fund a municipal pilot
subtitle: Cost: 1 budget capacity. Small, safe and hard for anyone to object to.
choose-if: budget >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Requires one budget point.
on-arrival: budget -= 1; household_security += 4; local_network += 2; government_delivery += 3; household_policy_pressure -= 4; government_goal_housing = 1; last_card_objection = 0; news_headline = "Municipal housing pilots begin"


Two hundred units in four municipalities, delivered by councils that already
have the land. Nobody in the coalition will die on this hill, which is both its
strength and its ceiling.

- #poland_card_finish


@guarantee
title: Negotiate tenant guarantees first
subtitle: No spending. A statutory floor now; the homes stay unbuilt and the demand keeps growing.
on-arrival: household_security += 2; public_trust += 1; government_delivery += 1; household_policy_pressure += 3; progressives_dissent += 2; razem_dissent += 3; government_goal_housing = 1; last_card_objection = 0; news_headline = "Tenant guarantees precede the housing fund"


Eviction protection and notice periods are written into statute without a zloty
of new spending, which is a real gain for anyone facing a landlord this winter.

It is also the fourth consecutive year in which the ministry has produced a
guarantee instead of a building. The waiting lists lengthen against a promise
that is now legally enforceable and physically empty.

- #poland_card_finish
